SUMMARY:Small Groups: 50+ Social Hour Does Pickleball Drills!
DESCRIPTION:Come join us after celebrating Simchat Torah for pickleball drills! Pickleball is more fun with friends and when your game is on point. Drills help you build muscle memory and improve your shot technique. We will be coached by Pickleball Johnny and his team for a one-hour session. Cost is $25 paid directly to the instructor; further payment instructions will be included in the confirmation email. All levels welcome but some game experience is needed. Note: This session was originally for 50+ but is now open to any age! Register\n\nOrganizer: Mishkan Chicago\nRSVP Link: https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/small-groups-50-plus-pickleball-drills-10-04-26/
LOCATION:St Philip School Gym, 2500 West Bryn Mawr Ave., Chicago
URL:https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/small-groups-50-plus-pickleball-drills-10-04-26/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
