SUMMARY:Shabbat Morning Mishnah Study (Fall 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an extended Saturday Morning Mishnah from 8:45am-9:45am during Shabbat Services. Are you someone who loves studying rabbinic texts? Or perhaps you are thinking about exploring them for the first time? Join Rabbi Steven on Shabbat mornings to dive into the world of the rabbis. Texts will be in Hebrew and English. Feel free to join us at services after or to head out into your day! This program is drop-in and will meet from 8:45 – 9:45 AM before the following Saturday Morning Shabbat Services: 10/10, 10/24, 11/7, 11/21, 12/5, 12/19 If you plan on attending any of these sessions we ask that you register here . You only need to register once! We will send an email reminding you of upcoming sessions.\n\nOrganizer: Mishkan Chicago\nRSVP Link: https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/shabbat-morning-mishnah-study-fall-2026-10-10/
