SUMMARY:Small Groups: Letters for Democracy
DESCRIPTION:And just like that&#8230;. the midterms are less than 3 months away. There&#8217;s work to be done! Come write postcards to swing state voters with Builder Debbie Lessin and help turn out the vote for key elections. Debbie is hosting for windows, so if you need to come late or leave early that&#8217;s ok, just come be a part of the effort! We&#8217;ve got plenty of sessions, so come to one, or come to all! Register\n\nOrganizer: Mishkan Chicago\nRSVP Link: https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/small-groups-letters-for-democracy-10-16-26/
LOCATION:Builder Home in Bucktown, Chicago
