DTSTART:20261016T223000Z
DTEND:20261016T232000Z
SUMMARY:Volunteer Celebration Happy Hour
DESCRIPTION:We&#8217;re celebrating our volunteers! Over 60 of you helped make the High Holidays such a success, and that&#8217;s not even counting the dozens who&#8217;ve helped greet people at Shabbat or any of the many other ways people give their time to Mishkan. If you&#8217;re one of those people, come join us before services for some snacks and drinks. If you&#8217;re not yet, you can sign up for shifts here , we&#8217;d love to have you! Register\n\nOrganizer: Mishkan Chicago\nRSVP Link: https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/volunteer-celebration-happy-hour-10-16-26/
LOCATION:Second Unitarian Church, 656 W Barry Ave, Chicago
URL:https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/volunteer-celebration-happy-hour-10-16-26/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
