DTSTART:20261016T233000Z
DTEND:20261017T013000Z
SUMMARY:Friday Night Shabbat
DESCRIPTION:Join us for music from our Davening Team, uplifting liturgy, and reflection from our rabbis. Music, prayer and special guests will differ week to week, but you can always count on this Friday wind down to leave you feeling nourished and inspired. Join us before services for Volunteer Happy Hour, where we&#8217;ll celebrate the volunteers that bring warmth and joy to every Mishkan event. We&#8217;ll also celebrate Ronan Goforth and Caleb Walker with an auf ruf. Watch the livestream on Mishkan’s YouTube channel. Coming for the first time? Let us know who you are so we can give you a special hello and introduce you to other Mishkanites. Looking to help out? We’re in need of volunteer greeters to welcome people into Mishkan before services. You can sign up here or email Michael at michael@mishkanchicago.org for more information!\n\nOrganizer: Mishkan Chicago\nRSVP Link: https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/friday-night-shabbat-10-16-2026/
LOCATION:Second Unitarian Church, 656 W Barry Ave, Chicago
URL:https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/friday-night-shabbat-10-16-2026/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
