SUMMARY:Mitzvah Bag Making: For Those in Need
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever walked past someone experiencing homelessness and wished you could help, but didn’t have any cash or extra food with you?\n\nAt this event, we’ll come together to make small giveaway bags filled with sustainable, practical items and materials for people in need. You can keep a few in your backpack, car, or wherever you spend your time—so the next time you encounter someone who could use a little support, you’ll have something ready to give.\n\nAs the weather gets colder, these small acts of kindness can make a meaningful difference. Do a mitzvah, prepare to help, and spread a little warmth throughout our community!\n\nOrganizer: Moishe House: Wrigleyville\nRSVP Link: https://partiful.com/e/0BGbtDJfUqz2UrLVjXuI?c=LtsSahW9
LOCATION:Lakeview / Wrigleyville
