SUMMARY:How to Talk to Loved Ones: About the Midterms, at Thanksgiving, and Beyond
DESCRIPTION:Join Michael Palmer and Rabbi Steven for a workshop that offers communication skill-building for difficult conversations and a framework for vibrant dialogue across diverse viewpoints, backgrounds, and generations. Using the approach provided by Resetting the Table , we’ll focus on issues that are front of mind for American Jews as we approach the Midterm elections. Participants exchange views and personal experiences, surface differences and commonalities, and practice skills for addressing differences honestly and constructively. Pizza will be provided at 5:30 PM with the workshop starting at 6:00 PM. Register\n\nOrganizer: Mishkan Chicago\nRSVP Link: https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/midterms-resetting-the-table-10-21-2026/
