SUMMARY:Spiritual Technology for a Broken World
DESCRIPTION:How do we respond to a broken world? The early rabbis formed our tradition during a time when it felt like everything was falling apart. Recognizing that we can’t always fix things, they developed spiritual technology to help us navigate disaster, show up for one another, and build the kinds of communities that can help us through whatever comes next. Join Rabbi Steven for a 4-part series about these ancient tools &#8211; and how we can apply them to our lives today. Register\n\nOrganizer: Mishkan Chicago\nRSVP Link: https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/spiritual-technology-for-a-broken-world-10-23-26/
LOCATION:Sketchpad, 4411 N Ravenswood, Chicago
URL:https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/spiritual-technology-for-a-broken-world-10-23-26/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
