SUMMARY:Shabbat Morning Mishnah Study (Fall 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Are you someone who loves studying rabbinic texts? Or perhaps you are thinking about exploring them for the first time? Join Rabbi Steven before services on Shabbat mornings (there will be coffee!) to dive into the world of the rabbis. We will begin with Pirkei Avot, a compilation of rabbinic wisdom from the 1st and 2nd centuries CE. Texts will be in Hebrew and English. This program is drop-in and will meet from 8:45 – 9:45 AM before the following Saturday Morning Shabbat Services: 10/10, 10/24, 11/7, 11/21, 12/5, 12/19 If you plan on attending any of these sessions we ask that you register here . You only need to register once! We will send an email reminding you of upcoming sessions.\n\nOrganizer: Mishkan Chicago\nRSVP Link: https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/shabbat-morning-mishnah-study-fall-2026-10-24/
LOCATION:Mishkan Chicago HQ, 4001 N Ravenswood Ave #101, Chicago
URL:https://www.mishkanchicago.org/event/shabbat-morning-mishnah-study-fall-2026-10-24/
